From 582120d04ecf6f59da28e838fcab3322a6d2d8bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:41:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] World generation hook, chunk loading and configs (API block
 14)

Capability chunks: chunk-loaded (where a mod adds its ores, with
world.set-blocks) and set-forced (the mod's own chunk tickets, never a
player's /forceload); SDK config helper over storage; oregen-demo example
with harness support. API level 13.
